WEBVTT

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:09.160
Cursed dragon, come out and 
muster your dark power!

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:13.020
I ride Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.890
Interesting...

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:33.210
The power fills up inside my body just 
as it does with Phantom Blaster Dragon...

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:41.090
As long as I have this power, I 
can do what I want with you...

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.830
It's boring to just humiliate you.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:51.640
I think I'll transform you into 
the very thing you hate the most.

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:41.210
Then I'll call a Phantom 
Blaster Dragon here, too.

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:51.790
And now, I'm going to make my move.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:56.540
I attack with my Vanguard, 
Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:01.330
I guard with...

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:04.470
Alabaster Owl and Star Call Trumpeter!

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:07.370
I also intercept with Bedivere!

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:14.000
20000 total shield and 
Blaster Blade's 9000...

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.480
It's possible to guard against him!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:21.030
The Truth of Psyqualia

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:24.490
Check the drive trigger.

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:28.200
Second check.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.950
I got a critical trigger.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:36.350
I give all of the effects to my 
rear-guard Phantom Blaster Dragon.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:42.430
Even the rear-guard Phantom Blaster 
Dragon has a 2 critical...

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:44.840
Aichi...

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:09.080
Phantom Blaster Dragon...

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.210
No guard!

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:25.040
Picture it...

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.770
Can't move, can you?

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:58.490
What do you think, Aichi?

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:02.550
Frustrating, isn't it? You want 
to get stronger, don't you?

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.920
There's only one way to do that.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.130
N-No...

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:23.370
No!

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:37.840
Why? If you used it, you 
could be strong again...

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:44.080
Aichi, don't you want revenge for last night?

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:44.680
Huh?

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.620
You remember, don't you?

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:51.030
I trampled him, made him 
look stupid and pathetic...

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:54.450
He could do nothing but surrender...

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:58.480
I'm talking about that loser, Kai.

00:05:59.510 --> 00:06:01.550
Don't talk about Kai that way!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:05.850
How passionate. Burning anger is good...

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:07.270
But it's pointless.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.340
Right now, you have no power.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:15.140
No matter how much you crave 
revenge, you can't gain it.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:15.870
Right?

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:37.730
Brother!

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.940
What on Earth happened?!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:42.960
Damage check...

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.230
Second check...

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.190
Turn end.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.310
I want to beat him!

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:03.430
But...

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:09.280
Stand and draw!

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:16.350
See the king in his younger days 
as he blazes a trail with his knights!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:16.920
I ride...

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:20.680
Alfred Early!

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:27.650
Next, the King of Knights' 
sworn ally stands at his side!

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:31.280
I superior call Blaster Blade!

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:35.720
Exit the field, Phantom Blaster Dragon!

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.160
Silly.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:54.740
You'll never beat me with 
weak units like that.

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:16.220
Impending danger and anger are the 
keys to activating his Psyqualia...

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:19.480
And if you use Psyqualia...

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:21.650
...you'll become what you were.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:26.270
That's right. You'll become 
what you most detest.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.760
That being said, you still won't win.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:41.440
Psyqualia has told me that victory is mine.

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:45.610
I can control everything,

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:48.200
from the direction of the 
fight to what happens to you.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.320
I'm sure Kai feels bitter, too.

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:56.290
His friend won't avenge him,

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:58.530
or even try to get stronger...

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.630
But I guess that can't be helped, huh?

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:07.870
In the end, both you and Kai are insects.

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:10.670
You're powerless against me.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.560
Being crushed by me is inevitable.

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:16.860
I...

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.680
I'm not going to take any more from you.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.280
Aichi Sendou's Psyqualia 
has finally activated!

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.490
What's wrong, Rekka?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.690
The time has come.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:45.990
Don't tell me...

00:09:47.340 --> 00:09:51.730
That's right. It's me. I'm 
borrowing Rekka's body.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.320
I have to see what happens for myself.

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:04.310
Light isn't the only thing 
standing beside him.

00:10:04.310 --> 00:10:07.740
Darkness also stands with 
the King of Knights.

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:10.920
Stand, my avatar!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:12.840
I call...

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.050
Blaster Dark!

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.480
Say what?!

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:24.720
That's from...

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:27.190
Shadow Paladin!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.110
Blaster Dark...

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:10.800
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:17.810
Yeah. The last time Brother used 
that deck, it's like it changed him.

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:20.920
Not this time, too...?

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:26.410
With a boost from Wingal Brave,

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:29.220
Blaster Blade attacks!

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:32.420
Guard!

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:34.390
Death Feather Eagle...

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.880
With a boost from Marron, Alfred Early...

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.180
Twin drive...

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:50.130
First check.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.180
Second check...

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:57.450
Draw trigger. I give the 
power to Blaster Dark.

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:12.430
It's been a long time, Blaster Dark.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:15.000
It's your attack at last.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:19.600
Let's use our power to make 
Ren feel helplessness,

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:22.440
and despair!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.620
Please picture it.

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:38.820
What?

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:48.680
I had forgotten how this felt.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.080
Power is coursing through my body.

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:59.930
Please, have a taste. It's your favorite...

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:02.860
Despair and the abyss of powerlessness!

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:11.010
Ren!

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:25.340
There you go, Aichi!

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:29.440
You've become what you hated the most.

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:37.600
Aichi!

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.270
I don't believe it...

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:40.240
Aichi...

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.900
What happened to him?

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:43.650
I dunno...

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:44.800
This doesn't bode well...

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:47.300
Aichi...

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.010
Aichi...

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:58.450
The sixth turn is over!

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:03.360
At the moment, Sendou has 4 damage 
and Suzugamori has 5 damage.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.850
Surprisingly, Sendou has 
cornered his opponent!

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:08.470
Nobody anticipated this happening.

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:12.990
Still, it's a certainty that Suzugamori is 
aiming to turn it around in his next turn.

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:16.430
But it's too early to tell what 
the outcome of this match will be.

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:20.160
Well, I think we can expect 
a b-<i>o</i>-dacious climax!

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:21.900
It's s-<i>o</i> exciting!

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:33.270
Sometimes a person changes 
when they use Psyqualia.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:37.670
That troubles you, doesn't it?

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:39.070
I...

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:43.290
But that can't be helped.

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:47.500
The chaos on our world, Cray...

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.130
You know about it.

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:50.450
Yes...

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:56.590
I've heard that the planet is being 
invaded by a mysterious power.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:02.340
After that power passes through, 
all life in the area is lost...

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:08.770
Correct. All of the clans on our 
world are facing extinction.

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:13.920
However, two of these clans 
have conflicting opinions.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:25.790
All of the clans should come under our 
command and devote their lives to us!

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:28.170
Do that, and I promise you victory!

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:31.890
That wouldn't give rise to true power!

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:35.890
We need to be united and help each other!

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:39.740
What's important is equal 
solidarity between the clans.

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:43.250
Without that, we can't win this war!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:47.160
And so, both sides went 
to war with each other...

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:52.690
All of the clans will obey the 
will of whichever one wins.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.490
That battle

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:02.440
is happening right now on our world.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:21.350
Now... It's really happening right now?

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.200
Correct.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.020
Whichever side wins

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:29.840
will determine how we stand up 
against the mysterious force.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:32.900
The fate of our world will be decided.

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:35.670
And those Vanguards...

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.110
...will bring about the outcome.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:43.050
When those two activated their Psyqualia,

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.860
for the first time, they became

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:48.980
the Vanguards told of in our legends.

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:52.760
Vanguards...

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:58.680
The ones who will deal with the chaos on our 
world and lead us down the correct path.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:05.800
The true power of Psyqualia involves 
synchronizing those who possess that ability

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:07.910
with our world.

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:11.340
In other words, the outcome of their match

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:15.120
will be synchronized with the 
result of the battle on our world.

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:19.210
Similar situations have happened in the past.

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:24.130
But each time, the former 
Vanguards were leaders...

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:27.630
Psyqualia's true function...

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:32.400
This is all to guide our world...

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:41.200
So you finally used Psyqualia, eh?

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:44.130
But you're still going to lose this fight.

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:47.360
That's what Psyqualia tells me.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:55.950
Have you ever fought against another 
person who possesses Psyqualia?

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:59.540
This is a fight without precedent.

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.560
Neither one of us knows 
what's going to happen.

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:07.990
You may be the one who'll 
feel despair and humiliation.

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:18.770
Interesting...

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:25.150
Stop!

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:29.610
Aichi!

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:32.300
Kai...?

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:36.780
Listen to me, Aichi Sendou!

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.760
That's not the real you!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.540
Remember your fight with me, Aichi!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.790
Don't lose your true self!

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:08.860
The me from before...

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:10.710
The real...

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:17.320
If you aren't the real Aichi, then who is?

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:21.070
Hungry for power, seeking to 
become stronger than anyone...

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:25.680
That is certainly the true Aichi 
that was lurking within you.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.620
Yes, the same as me!

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:32.080
I... I...

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:34.970
The true me...

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.620
The true me is...

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:43.910
Aichi...

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:00.940
Final Turn!

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:06.560
What?!

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:07.690
Final Turn?!

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:11.370
There it is at last! "Final Turn"!

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:15.960
Ren Suzugamori of Team AL4 has dominated 
the National Championship twice!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:20.880
That very person has declared that he's 
going to finish off his opponent this turn!

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.480
There it is...

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:23.590
Aichi...

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.240
Ren...

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:34.070
It seems that what Psyqualia showed me...

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.810
...was absolutely correct.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.870
Crying out in despair in the 
chaos that is silence...

00:20:42.610 --> 00:20:47.110
The power of shadowy darkness, 
obscuring all vision, is mine.

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:49.400
I crossride...

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.220
Phantom Blaster Overlord!

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:36.160
Remember, Aichi...

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:38.540
...what happened last night...

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:42.460
Phantom Blaster Overlord...

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:45.690
...delivers its final blow to The End!

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:03.060
If you're not going to use Psyqualia, 
I'll just have to make you realize...

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:09.940
"The powerless fall into despair, and 
those with power get all the glory."

00:23:50.850 --> 00:23:53.760
So that's Phantom Blaster Overlord!

00:23:55.040 --> 00:23:57.730
You and I have the same nature.

00:23:58.320 --> 00:24:01.080
You mustn't look away from the truth.

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:05.160
We're Cardfighters who can use Psyqualia!

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:09.930
We're special. We both sought overwhelming 
power, and we've both been chosen.

00:24:09.930 --> 00:24:13.690
There's one part of me that seeks that 
power... and another that rejects it!

00:24:14.060 --> 00:24:16.190
Next time: Awakening of Twin Blades!

00:24:16.190 --> 00:24:19.720
Two images will now become one truth!
